{"id":"msg_m_ex_primadonna_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_primadonna","label":"Prima Donna · Group"},"label":"3. How's everyone doing?","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_primadonna_02","next":"msg_m_ex_primadonna_04","speakers":{"noise":"Noise","volume":"Volume","aria":"Aria"},"icons":{"noise":"si_c430_00_s","volume":"si_c431_00_s","aria":"si_c432_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_1","text":"How's everyone doing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_2","text":"Hi, guys.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_3","text":"Just resting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_4","text":"What's up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_5","text":"I've had something on my mind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_6","text":"What's that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_7","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_8","text":"I think I'm going through a slump.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_9","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_10","text":"Did something happen?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_11","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_12","text":"I don't seem to like any of the songs I've been working on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_13","text":"I've put a lot of effort into them, but they're all no good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_14","text":"Before,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_15","text":"I used to be able to finish a recording in just a few hours,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_16","text":"and when I was done, I was in love with it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_17","text":"Oh no!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_18","text":"That doesn't seem like you at all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_19","text":"You've toppled me from the top of the charts","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_20","text":"too many times to count.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_21","text":"Settle down, Volume.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_22","text":"You've gone through periods of doubt","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_23","text":"just like this at least once before.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_24","text":"Yeah...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_25","text":"that's true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_26","text":"Being an artist sounds tough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_27","text":"How about you take a break?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_28","text":"Maybe you've overworked yourself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_29","text":"Take a breather and take some time to recharge.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_30","text":"Once you do that, I'm sure you'll be back to your old self again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_31","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_32","text":"I thought about that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_33","text":"but I feel like the more I rest, the more my skills decline.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_34","text":"If anything, I think that'd make the situation worse.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_35","text":"So that got me thinking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_36","text":"Have you come up with something?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_37","text":"Yeah, there is one thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_38","text":"How about I change the way that I practice?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_39","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_40","text":"Rather than resting,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_41","text":"you're going to practice even more?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_42","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_43","text":"If I try a new approach,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_44","text":"I might be able to make new discoveries","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_45","text":"and find my voice once again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_46","text":"That's a very Noise idea.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_47","text":"Is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_48","text":"Hearing you say that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_49","text":"fills me with confidence.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_50","text":"I say we all can offer our own ideas to Noise as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_51","text":"All right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_52","text":"I think that's a great idea.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_53","text":"Okay!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_54","text":"Me first.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_55","text":"At first, I hired the most expensive trainer around who was supposed to be the best,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_56","text":"but he turned out to be garbage.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_57","text":"He claimed that my voice wasn't what was trending these days","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_58","text":"and that I had to change everything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_59","text":"So what'd you do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_60","text":"I fired him!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_61","text":"No one knows better than me what I need to do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_62","text":"And my fans love my voice!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_63","text":"So my training method is","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_64","text":"to trust yourself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_65","text":"Mmm,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_66","text":"trusting yourself is important.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_67","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_67","text":"Very cool, Volume. What about you, Aria?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_68","text":"Whenever I practice,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_69","text":"I imagine the day of the performance.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_70","text":"A massive stage all lit up,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_71","text":"the stadium filled with an adoring crowd,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_72","text":"and me standing in the middle,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_73","text":"with all eyes on me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_74","text":"Wow...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_75","text":"If you use your imagination","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_76","text":"to make yourself feel like you're actually on stage,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_77","text":"then your focus increases,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_78","text":"and you get a lot more out of practice.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_79","text":"So I can practice while imagining how the audience will receive it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_80","text":"That's a great idea.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_81","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_81","text":"For me, it has to do with karaoke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_82","text":"Oh, er...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_83","text":"that's okay, Producer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_84","text":"You don't have to share your method with me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_85","text":"The fact you comforted me earlier is already more than enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_86","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_86","text":"No, I want to tell you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_87","text":"Actually, I really ought to start practicing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_88","text":"I feel like I'm in the groove,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_89","text":"and I think I'll be able to get back to recording in no time!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_90","text":"That's my girl!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"volume","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_91","text":"That's the spirit!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"aria","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_92","text":"It's important just to try.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_93","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_93","text":"But I'm not finished...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_94","text":"Thanks, everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_primadonna_03_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"noise","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_primadonna_03_95","text":"I better get going to start my practice now!","jump":null}],"chat":true}